<concept otherprops="legalnotice_europe-general_egall_2023_20230101_0003011" id="t00152">
	<title>Manual transmission shift indicator</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00755">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00756">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="images/N_SP3i25_C00_092_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>This indicator informs which gear is desired while driving to save fuel.</p>
		<ul id="e00757">
			<li>
				<p>Shifting up: ▲2, ▲3, ▲4, ▲5, ▲6</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Shifting down: *▼1, *▼2, ▼3, ▼4, ▼5</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>For example</p>
		<p>▲3: Indicates that shifting up to the 3rd gear is desired (currently the shift lever is in the 2nd or 1st gear).</p>
		<p>▼4: Indicates that shifting down to the 4th gear is desired (currently the shift lever is in the 5th or 6th gear).</p>
	</conbody>
